          "type": "text",
          "text": "Community planners considered limited storage space while preparing a capacity check for the mangrove research station. Researchers carry the equipment along a narrow mangrove boardwalk. The design must also be explained clearly in the safety briefing. A solid is formed by joining a cone of radius 3 cm and height 4 cm to a hemisphere of the same radius. Find the total volume in cm³, correct to 1 decimal place."
        }
      ],
